"Qi and Blood Realm! It's done!"
In a high-end villa, Yang Yi suddenly opened his eyes, looking excited;
The loose training clothes on his body seemed to bulge for a moment, then subsided.
"Chu Yuan! Come fight!"
Chu Yuan glanced at him inexplicably;
"Ahem, forget it." Yang Yi suddenly remembered that he had reached the Qi and Blood realm, but the monster Chu Yuan had already reached the Inner Breath realm several days ago.
This is Yang Yi's own practice room, which contains a set of energy gathering arrays, which are no less efficient than those in the school;
After returning from school every day, Yang Yi would practice at home for a few more hours.
As he expected, after Chu Yuan helped refine the second Diamond Pill, he naturally broke through to the Qi and Blood Realm and became an official warrior!
Martial Arts University is already a certainty, but we can’t relax now;
After all, there are differences between universities. If you can go to a better one, you will naturally go to a better one!
Yang Yi secretly warned himself and saw Chu Yuan starting to practice cross-legged;
There was a surge of admiration in my heart again.
In the past two days, every time Chu Yuan helped him refine the Vajra Pill, he would practice it for a while by himself;
Regarding this kind of behavior of rubbing the energy gathering array, Yang Yi had no idea. This loss was nothing to him.
But there is really nothing to say about Yang Yi who is more talented, has better opportunities, and works harder than me.
Just as he was about to follow the practice, he suddenly remembered something and said;
"By the way, Chu Yuan, there is one thing."
Chu Yuan opened his eyes and said, "What?"
"I have investigated Zhou Zhe's matter clearly, and there is someone behind him." Yang Yi thought about it for a moment, "He is from the Li family in the state capital, the transfer student from Class 1;
I found out that it was he who encouraged Zhou Zhe to come to trouble you."
A smile appeared on Chu Yuan's face. Of course he had known about this for a long time. The principal had already told him;
But he didn't expect that Yang Yi still had this heart.
Whether it's because of his own value or some other reason, Yang Yi did it, and that's enough.
"Don't laugh, this matter is very troublesome." Yang Yi was also a little irritated, "Although I don't know why he targeted you, the Li family in the state capital is not that simple;
Before the college entrance examination is over, you'd better be careful.
If it really doesn't work, don't go to school. Anyway, the energy gathering array at my house is no worse than the one at school. "
Chu Yuan shook his head and didn't explain much. He simply said, "It's okay."
Seeing that he didn't take his reminder to heart, Yang Yi was a little angry at first;
But then I thought about it. The unknown ‘teacher’ behind Chu Yuan was also thoughtful for a moment and stopped trying to persuade him.
The two people's thoughts were completely different;
Yang Yi felt that Chu Yuan had a background and confidence;
But in fact, perhaps Chu Yuan’s biggest background now is the principal?
What's more, on the day Zhou Zhe asked for trouble, he had already provoked Li Chen;
Although there has been no movement from the other party in the past two days, Chu Yuan doesn't think that Li Chen will definitely take action in the future if he is so arrogant.
This is what a spoiled child is like. Before it hurts him completely, any warnings in words or attitudes are useless.
Nor indeed was he afraid;
There is a concept that needs to be clear: Li Chen is Li Chen, and the Li family of the state capital is the Li family of the state capital.
